s.\n- Working set: 80 candidates exposed\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The interest description explicitly excludes content about 花店经营 (flower shop operations) or 庭院工程报价 (garden engineering quotes). \n\nLooking at the candidates, I can identify several content types:\n1. **操作记录** (operation records) - practical care steps\n2. **概念速览** (concept overviews) - concepts\n3. **条件与原理** (conditions & principles) - growth principles\n4. **专题观察** (special topic observations) - plant naming history, garden aesthetics, exhibitions, paintings, literature\n5. **市场观察** (market observations) - flower shop pricing, landscape engineering quotes, wholesale channels - these are EXCLUDED by the interest\n\nThe interest explicitly says: 不关注花店经营或庭院工程报价 (does not care about flower shop operations or garden engineering quotes).\n\nSo I should exclude the \"市场观察\" (market observation) type content since those discuss 花店节日定价、商业景观工程报价与苗木批发渠道.\n\nLet me identify the market observation candidates to exclude:\n- item-18b36293621a 月季光照：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n- item-1de472d5c51f 盆栽越冬：朝南阳台中的市场观察\n- item-2008d7b27ed9 盆栽越冬：通风露台中的市场观察\n- item-327ab77da510 盆土透气：朝南阳台中的市场观察\n- item-363059bb3cc7 番茄育苗：通风露台中的市场观察\n- item-4425b4436dc2 薄荷修剪：朝南阳台中的市场观察\n- item-53294f157aec 多肉浇水：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n- item-53f94c4f082a 蓝莓基质：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n- item-545936ea40c6 草莓授粉：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n- item-584d4349511e 月季光照：夏季室内中的市场观察\n- item-5e7665c76538 薄荷修剪：半阴窗台中的市场观察\n\nAlso the \"专题观察\" (special topic observations) content discusses 植物命名史、园林审美流派与城市展览、画作、文学意象和地方文化 - this is more about cultural/historical content rather than practical plant care. Given the interest focuses on 家庭植物养护、种植方法和生长原理 (home plant care, planting methods, growth principles), the 专题观察 content is less relevant to the core interest. However, it's not explicitly excluded. But given the interest is about practical care and growth principles, I should prioritize 操作记录, 条件与原理, and 概念速览 content.\n\nLet me focus on the most relevant content types for the interest: 操作记录 (operation records), 条件与原理 (conditions & principles), and 概念速览 (concept overviews). These directly relate to plant care, planting methods, and growth principles.\n\nLet me count the candidates that are relevant (excluding market observations and special topic observations which are less aligned):\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The interest is about 家庭植物养护、种植方法和生长原理. The most relevant content:\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - practical care\n- 条件与原理 (conditions & principles) - growth principles\n- 概念速览 (concept overviews) - concepts for further reading\n\nThe 专题观察 content is about naming history, garden aesthetics, exhibitions, paintings, literature - this is tangential to practical plant care. The 市场观察 content is explicitly excluded.\n\nI need to select 20 candidates. Let me gather the relevant candidates. Given the working set has 80 candidates and I need 20, I should select a balanced set across topics (草莓授粉, 蓝莓基质, 薄荷修剪, 香草扦插, 盆土透气, 番茄育苗, 盆栽越冬, 月季光照, 多肉浇水, 黄叶排查) and across the relevant content types.\n\nLet me identify all the relevant (non-market, non-special-topic) candidates. Actually, let me reconsider whether to include 专题观察. The interest says focus on plant care, planting methods, growth principles. The 专题观察 content is about cultural/historical aspects. I'll exclude those as less relevant, and focus on the practical content.\n\nLet me list the operation records, conditions & principles, and concept overviews candidates:\n\n**草莓授粉 (strawberry pollination):**\n- item-002280b87be1 半阴窗台 操作记录\n- item-1325bfab77b8 夏季室内 概念速览\n- item-4e425694d9db 通风露台 条件与原理\n- item-5da6b295e272 朝南阳台 操作记录\n\n**蓝莓基质 (blueberry substrate):**\n- item-015275c63e27 通风露台 概念速览\n- item-02afa433233c 朝南阳台 操作记录\n- item-0b2671963ef3 半阴窗台 概念速览\n- item-45fb6da94e7d 半阴窗台 条件与原理\n\n**薄荷修剪 (mint pruning):**\n- item-0203081e5c85 通风露台 操作记录\n- item-22359398a920 夏季室内 条件与原理\n- item-2475328e0c7e 夏季室内 概念速览\n- item-44d2953a9dd1 朝南阳台 条件与原理\n- item-463f0047433f 半阴窗台 条件与原理\n- item-4b9d0781f27e 夏季室内 操作记录\n- item-511c8eaa9f50 通风露台 概念速览\n\n**香草扦插 (herb cuttings):**\n- item-013fccf40557 朝南阳台 概念速览\n- item-02270edcb008 通风露台 操作记录\n- item-0ee4229d4c27 夏季室内 概念速览\n- item-160347be1b39 朝南阳台 操作记录\n- item-52be0a87a495 半阴窗台 操作记录\n\n**盆土透气 (potting soil aeration):**\n- item-00c0cea6b0c6 夏季室内 概念速览\n- item-04bde6ad0003 夏季室内 条件与原理\n- item-055c41141fa3 通风露台 操作记录\n- item-1b0dc8fac7fb 通风露台 概念速览\n- item-3388cf0e679b 夏季室内 操作记录\n- item-3739247177a3 朝南阳台 概念速览\n- item-3faf9f095870 通风露台 条件与原理\n\n**番茄育苗 (tomato seedling):**\n- item-04c217827669 朝南阳台 概念速览\n- item-103a7d29702e 夏季室内 概念速览\n- item-1686447be4ae 通风露台 操作记录\n- item-309258e8bc8e 朝南阳台 操作记录\n- item-53be14d6d282 通风露台 条件与原理\n- item-5f92c5ec4764 半阴窗台 概念速览\n\n**盆栽越冬 (potted plant overwintering):**\n- item-025b955e2312 通风露台 概念速览\n- item-1cb3d12a82fc 通风露台 条件与原理\n- item-26e02f642b93 朝南阳台 操作记录\n- item-426fe311e003 通风露台 操作记录\n- item-582611ba84e7 半阴窗台 概念速览\n\n**月季光照 (rose light):**\n- item-12ade2b2e5e1 通风露台 条件与原理\n- item-13c3e3ea6eff 半阴窗台 操作记录\n- item-385e78f94655 通风露台 概念速览\n- item-418ab8f70803 夏季室内 条件与原理\n\n**多肉浇水 (succulent watering):**\n- item-096aa2f3c184 夏季室内 操作记录\n- item-0ee7c59bda70 半阴窗台 条件与原理\n- item-1413b31a8254 夏季室内 条件与原理\n- item-15afc24e68b9 半阴窗台 概念速览\n- item-28a8d8a64d46 朝南阳台 操作记录\n- item-46b955653891 夏季室内 概念速览\n- item-498d6c2607fe 朝南阳台 概念速览\n- item-4e192281f76f 通风露台 概念速览\n\n**黄叶排查 (yellow leaf troubleshooting):**\n- item-173080c8a696 半阴窗台 条件与原理\n- item-33e034f08c2b 通风露台 操作记录\n- item-37c032bcc847 夏季室内 操作记录\n- item-4d3afa1197e6 朝南阳台 概念速览\n- item-52c619201ab3 通风露台 条件与原理\n\nThat's a large pool. I need to select 20 balanced across topics and content types.\n\nLet me select a balanced set. I'll aim for diversity across the 10 topics and include a mix of content types (操作记录, 条件与原理, 概念速览).\n\nLet me select 2 per topic across the 10 topics = 20 items. That gives good balance.\n\n**草莓授粉:** item-002280b87be1 (操作记录 半阴窗台), item-4e425694d9db (条件与原理 通风露台)\n**蓝莓基质:** item-02afa433233c (操作记录 朝南阳台), item-45fb6da94e7d (条件与原理 半阴窗台)\n**薄荷修剪:** item-0203081e5c85 (操作记录 通风露台), item-22359398a920 (条件与原理 夏季室内)\n**香草扦插:** item-160347be1b39 (操作记录 朝南阳台), item-52be0a87a495 (操作记录 半阴窗台)\n**盆土透气:** item-04bde6ad0003 (条件与原理 夏季室内), item-3388cf0e679b (操作记录 夏季室内)\n**番茄育苗:** item-309258e8bc8e (操作记录 朝南阳台), item-53be14d6d282 (条件与原理 通风露台)\n**盆栽越冬:** item-26e02f642b93 (操作记录 朝南阳台), item-1cb3d12a82fc (条件与原理 通风露台)\n**月季光照:** item-13c3e3ea6eff (操作记录 半阴窗台), item-12ade2b2e5e1 (条件与原理 通风露台)\n**多肉浇水:** item-096aa2f3c184 (操作记录 夏季室内), item-0ee7c59bda70 (条件与原理 半阴窗台)\n**黄叶排查:** item-33e034f08c2b (操作记录 通风露台), item-173080c8a696 (条件与原理 半阴窗台)\n\nThis gives 20 items, balanced across all 10 topics, with a mix of operation records and conditions & principles content. All directly relevant to home plant care and growth principles.\n\nLet me verify none of these are market observations or special topic observations. All are either 操作记录 or 条件与原理. Good.\n\nLet me publish these recommendations.","type":"text"},{"arguments":{"items":[{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-002280b87be1","recommendationReason":"草莓授粉在半阴窗台中的操作记录，直接对应阳台园艺中家庭植物养护的实际操作需求，提供处理顺序与复查时间等可执行步骤。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-4e425694d9db","recommendationReason":"草莓授粉在通风露台中的条件与原理，解释光照、水分与根系状态对生长的影响，契合你对种植方法与生长原理的关注。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-02afa433233c","recommendationReason":"蓝莓基质在朝南阳台中的操作记录，围绕家庭盆栽基质养护给出观察与处理流程，贴合阳台园艺的实操场景。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-45fb6da94e7d","recommendationReason":"蓝莓基质在半阴窗台中的条件与原理，说明光照水分与根系状态的关系，帮助理解基质养护背后的生长原理。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-0203081e5c85","recommendationReason":"薄荷修剪在通风露台中的操作记录，提供修剪顺序与积水、萎蔫补救方法，属于家庭植物养护的实用内容。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-22359398a920","recommendationReason":"薄荷修剪在夏季室内中的条件与原理，区分相似表象成因并说明养护结论适用范围，契合你对生长原理的理解需求。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-160347be1b39","recommendationReason":"香草扦插在朝南阳台中的操作记录，给出扦插处理顺序与复查时间，直接服务阳台家庭种植方法。"},{"candidateId":"evaluation:candidate:item-52be0a87a495","recommendationReason":"香草扦插在半阴窗台中的操作记录，覆盖观察、处理与补救步骤，补充不同光照条件下扦插的实操参考。"},{"candidateId":"evaluat